flowchart TD
    %% Input
    A[Input: Survey Polygons (GeoJSON/KML)] --> B[Input: UAV Fleet & Sensors]
    A --> C[Input: Environment (Wind, Temp, GSD, Overlap)]
    A --> D[Input: Optimization Criterion (Min‑Time / Min‑Energy)]

    %% Pre‑processing
    B --> E[Normalize & Validate Geometry]
    C --> F[Compute Ground‑Speed Vectors & Drift]
    D --> G[Select Optimizer Mode]

    %% 1️⃣ Cellular Decomposition
    E --> H[Boustrophedon Cellular Decomposition (BCD)]
    H --> I[Generate Coverage Cells (polygons)]

    %% 2️⃣ Cell Allocation
    I --> J[Allocate Cells to UAVs]
    J -->|Kinematic limits (Vmax, Rmin)| K[Load‑Balancing (area, endurance)]

    %% 3️⃣ Path Generation per UAV
    K --> L[For each UAV: Sort Cells (space‑filling curve)]
    L --> M[Generate Dubins/Omega‑Bulb Turns]
    M --> N[Apply Altitude Echeloning (≥ 50 m separation)]

    %% 4️⃣ Post‑Processing & Validation
    N --> O[Check NFZ / Obstacle Collision]
    O --> P[Compute Battery / Energy Consumption]
    P --> Q[Validate Overlap & GSD]

    %% 5️⃣ Output
    Q --> R[Export: QGC .plan, GeoJSON, KML, MAVLink]
    style A fill:#f9f,stroke:#333
    style R fill:#9f9,stroke:#333
